Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay see I thought,I thought you meant how much was it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当年  全新时候的价钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when it was new, y'know like back then
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  就是说嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.65,0:06:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为是跳蚤市场   所以差不多1块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean it was at a flea market, so it was y'know, it was like a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1块钱  再加50元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A dollar? And fifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总共51元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it was like one and fifty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们用古法算钱  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, okay, they gave you the old-time pricing. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪个年代的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what period is it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往昔年代\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, it's from yore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是 "往昔的时代"  知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like, the "days of yore," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  真是太完美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just perfect. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一定有很棒的典故\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! I bet it has a great story behind it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卖方有提到它的出处或者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did they tell you anything? Like y’know where it was from or...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  这个我知道  它来自白原\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, that I know. This is from, uh, White Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白原\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}White Plains. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好神奇的一个地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, it sounds like such a magical place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! I'm here. Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗   完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You like it? Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的新药师桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's my new apothecary table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  菲比就快到了  不能让她看到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross! Phoebe'll be here any second. She can't see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  她一定会喜欢  这是好东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well why not?! She'll love it. It's the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是在陶瓷货仓买的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got it at Pottery Barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我也买了一张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know you did! I bought the same one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她看到你的桌子  就会知道我骗她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if she sees your table she's gonna know that I lied to her. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们的是原版  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told her ours was an original. Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她讨厌陶瓷货仓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because she hates Pottery Barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她讨厌陶瓷货仓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She hates Pottery Barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很惊讶  她说那是量产\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! I know, She says it's all mass-produced...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有真品  大家买的都一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...nothing is authentic, and everyone winds up having the same stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她随时都会进来  拿个东西先盖住  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So come on! she's gonna be here any second! Can we please just cover this up with something?! Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要遮遮掩掩的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not gonna hide it from Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我也买了很漂亮的床单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although I did get some great Pottery Barn sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了他们也出床单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, I forgot they made sheets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她居然会讨厌陶瓷货仓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still can't believe she hates Pottery Barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  别再念了  她又不是讨厌你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, get over it! It's not like she hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  她讨厌陶瓷货仓嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but Pottery Barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  她根本就是怪胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I think? It's just she-she's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她是双胞胎  双胞胎都很怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know it’s because she's a twin. Twins are weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  她不是怪胎  她只是希望她的东西独一无二\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, she's not weird. She just wants her stuff to be one-of-a-kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.23,0:08:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么才是最不独一无二的  双胞胎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh. You know what's not one-of-a-kind? A twin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比来了  把灯关掉  看电影吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, Phoebe's here! Okay, let's turn out the lights and watch the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的床单  喜欢是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Hey, ooh, cool sheet! You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想知道哪里买的吗  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to know where I got it? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在跳蚤市场买的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At a flea market.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去跳蚤市场买床单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You buy your sheets at a flea market?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  别这么小气吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross come on, you gotta loosen the purse strings a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚餐再过20分钟就好了  好兴奋喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The dinner will be ready in 20 minutes. This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你今晚要带过来的酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And here is the bottle of wine for you to bring over tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想送花给摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were also gonna buy Monica flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却买不起  因为你付了昨晚晚餐的钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but you couldn't afford it,because you paid for dinner last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  但今晚只有我要过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. But, uh, it's just gonna be me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉宁怎么了  她病得很重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to Janine? She's, uh, really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕  对啊  她整天都在房里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's too bad. Yeah, she's been in there all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发高烧  鼻塞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, high fever, nose problem. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痰痰痰痰痰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phlegm, phlegm, phlegm, phlegm, phlegm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡   钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica! Chandler!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚真抱歉  乔伊说了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really-really sorry about tonight. I don't know if Joey told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有出戏我一定得去看  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I just couldn't get out of going to this play. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩得开心点  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have a great time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪了  没有痰啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's funny, I saw no phlegm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  她真的病得很重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, she really is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她为什么要去看戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then why is she going to a play?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  感冒想退烧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, you know, "Starve a fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就要去看戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...go to a play for a cold."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   吉宁为什么不来吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! Why is Janine not coming over for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不想连续两晚都陪你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, she didn't want to hang out with you guys two nights in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么不想陪我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why doesn't she want to hang out with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她觉得  你很哈啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because she, uh, she-she thinks that you are "blah."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而摩妮卡  你的嗓门太大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that, uh, you, Monica, are too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她昨晚只是假装开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So she was just pretending to have a good time last night? 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她当面骗我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was lying to our faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太扯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她凭什么批评我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is she to judge us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们对她多好  我才不是哈啦  我是谈笑风生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We couldn't have been nicer to her. And I am not "blah." I am a hoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦  别生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, please, you guys. Don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure she just, she just said that stuff ...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紧张才会这么说  你们是我最好的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}because she was nervous and you guys are like my best friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又是第一次约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know? And it was our first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  她病得很重\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, she's really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明明说那是假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you sh—No you said you made that up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不觉得"生病"比"看戏"好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, but don't you think the "sick" thing is way better than the "play" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都很好  我通常都说  摩妮卡又醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eh, they're both good. I generally just go with, "Monica's drunk again."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦  再给她一次机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on you guys, please just give her another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定会喜欢你们的  我保证  当然好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She'll come around, I promise. Of course we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去煮饭吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, we gotta make dinner. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.63,0:11:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢那个女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do not like that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听得见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的嗓门真的很大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  别把脚翘在我的新\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Pheebs, could you please not put your feet up on my new...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旧床单上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...old sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的药师桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My apothecary table!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这张桌子是哪里买的  陶瓷货仓  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, where did you get this? I got it at Pottery Barn!! Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Phoebe,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陶瓷货仓抄袭我们古董的设计\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pottery Barn has ripped off the design of our antique!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  要是他们会抄袭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! Oh my God, well if they've ripped off our table...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那张桌子一定不止值51元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...ours must be worth much more than one and fifty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这张连鸦片的味道都没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well this doesn’t even smell like opium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有  只有你洒出来的酒味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course not, it smells like wine, which you spilled! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你还毁了我的床单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And thanks for wrecking my sheet by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  罗斯  我赔你80分就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, calm down. I'll give you the 80 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你还要柳橙汁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, would you like some more orange juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,音量刚刚好  就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Perfect decibel. I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  就是聊天哈啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing. We're just talking. You know, blah-blah-blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  你们说过要尽力的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, come on you guys, you said you were gonna try!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来找你们和吉宁一起去看电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I came over here to invite you guys to a movie with me and Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得呢  非常乐意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you say? I'd like to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我不确定有时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I'm not sure if we have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑  我也很无奈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, very funny. I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很希望你们处得来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really want you guys to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你们跟我们去吧  这是你们欠我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just please, come to the movie with us. I mean you owe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们欠你  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We owe you? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们刚交往时  我帮了很多忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I helped you guys out a lot in the start of your relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还帮你们偷鸡摸狗6个月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I helped you guys sneak around for like six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟白痴一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I looked like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还被羞辱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I was humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却只赚了2百\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I only made $200.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有给你钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We didn't give you any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.09,0:14:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我不知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't think I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该拿它配藤条餐桌椅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}see I can't decide whether it would go better next to the new wicker dining chair..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄色书桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the Sahara desk...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是螺形托脚桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or the Parker console table.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们这里也有陶瓷货仓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! I didn't know that there was a Pottery Barn up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我有点买疯了  有点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know. I went a little crazy. A little?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.69,0:14:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里就像目录第72页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your place looks like page 72 of the catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装饰  鸟笼  大号的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The ornamental birdcage! Large. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  小心  那个很老了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Ross? Be careful. That is very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殖民地时代早期的  鸟商  都用那个带 鸟上市场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Early Colonial bird merchants used to bring their birds to market in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又一个惊人的发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Another amazing find! Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.93,0:14:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它一定也有很棒的典故  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh I bet this has a great story too. It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:15:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是殖民地时期  分隔房间的装置\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is a room-separating apparatus from Colonial times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有好多东西都来自殖民地时期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh, a lot of this stuff is from the Colonial times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有哪些时期呢   瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are some other time periods, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有往昔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there's yore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有昨年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, and, uh, you know, yesteryear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋对这种东西真的很有眼光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah no, I'm telling you Rachel has such a good eye for this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  如果你家要重新布置\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, y'know if you ever decide to redecorate--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很有必要重新布置\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I think you should--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该找瑞秋帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you should ask Rachel to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他才不需要我的帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh honey, he doesn't need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  他早该扔掉那些  你是怎么说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on! I think he's ready to get rid of the. What'd you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,廉价的赝品和恐龙垃圾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The, uh, "cheap knockoffs and dinosaurjunk"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  既然你这么清楚我的需求\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, since you have such a great sense of what I need--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这里有60元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, here's 60 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带着菲比去殖民时期跳蚤市场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you take Phoebe down to that Colonial, uh, flea market...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我办货吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and get me some stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得菲比不会想去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? I don't, I don't think Phoebe wants to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我想去  她想去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! I do want to! She does want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想去  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She does want to. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我不知道该说什么  上次跳蚤市场还比较逛得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, I don't know what to say.I guess the flea market was just better last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我帮罗斯买了床单  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, at least I got these sheets for Ross. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  是陶瓷货仓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, look at this. Pottery Barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不懂  别看了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, yeah, you know what? Don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  别看了  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, don't look at it. No! Look-look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们抄袭我们的咖啡桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} There's the coffee table they stole from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些混蛋  我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, those bastards! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那台电风扇跟我们的有点像  还有那个乌笼和\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That fan kind of looks like ours, and the birdcage, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  这简直就像是我们的客厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a second, this is our exact living room!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  才不像呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} No! No it’s not! 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们的完全不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No it’s not! Come on, Phoebe, ours is totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有   我们没有那盏灯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, we don't have the - We don't have the…that lamp! .
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有那扇屏风  是在另一边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And-and that screen is y'know, on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  那些都是陶瓷货仓的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. This is where you got all our stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.10,0:17:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陶瓷货仓  我的天哪  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pottery Barn! Oh, my God! No. no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  你说对了  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay-okay look—no I did,, all right? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要这些东西  又知道你讨厌陶瓷货仓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted this stuff and I know how you feel about Pottery Barn.Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.15,0:17:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不要生气  但是我气死了  气死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on don't be mad. No-no-no, but I am mad!I am mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这代表世间所有丑恶的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because this stuff is everything that is wrong with the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在我的客厅里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it’s all sitting up in my living room...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我却只想着我没有那盏灯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and all I can think about is how I don't have that lamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就买下那盏灯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then, honey, buy the lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有罗斯给的60元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have that 60 bucks from Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我不买那盏灯   你就要搬走吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well are you saying that-that you would move out if-if I didn't buy that lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不会搬走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm not gonna move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说我不买那盏灯  你就要搬走吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But are you saying that you would move out if I didn't buy that lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我一定会搬走  那我就没办法了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Yes! I would so move out. Okay then I don't have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就得买那盏灯  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to buy that lamp! That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过至少那张药师桌是真货\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But at least the apothecary table is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好  大家都很尽兴吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this-this-this was great. Didn't everybody have a great time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很尽兴  真的  我想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did. I really did. And you guys, I've got to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉上次聚会后  我态度怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry if I was a little weird after the last time we went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是紧张吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I was just nervous or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完全可以理解  别放在心上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That’s totally understandable. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们可以再一起出去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we can go out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah! Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就晚安  晚安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, good night. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.44,0:18:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好玩吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wasn't that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们非搬家不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have got to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的嗓门也不小  死丫头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, you're not so quiet yourself, missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哈啦  比看现代舞更无聊的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm blah? Listen, The only thing more boring than watching modern dance...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是听你聊现代舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is having to listen to you talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Oh, Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才看得浑然忘我"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I just lost myself in the movement."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:19:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I know you're talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我只听到  叽哩呱啦叽哩呱啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but all I hear is blah-blah-blah-blah-blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你和我  现在出去  单挑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you and me! Let's go, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  够了  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right! All right! Enough! Enough! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  你们回去吧  我要跟吉宁谈一谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Enough! Enough! You two, go home. I gotta talk to Janine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对可以撂倒她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know I think you can take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我在走廊上碰到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'd better hope I don't see you in the hallway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个小小的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we've got a little bit of a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我的朋友  你不能对他们无礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These people are my friends; you can't treat them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也对我出言不逊   我知道  我会找他们谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They said stuff to me too. I know, I know! I'll talk to them about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们对我很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They mean so much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我的家人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're like my family, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们一见面就吵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you guys are gonna be fighting all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不可能在一起  这是行不通的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think we can be together.It just, it just can't work,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行不通的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我过去道歉呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would, would it help if I went over and apologized?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That would be very helpful! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过在走廊上碰到会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did I tell you about the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要过去向你们道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just coming over here to apologize for my behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很希望能跟你们做朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd really like it if we could be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那样会让乔伊很高兴  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I know that would make Joey happy, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.09,0:20:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I would like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能达成共识  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm glad we worked it out. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I'll see you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听都听得见  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or I'll hear you. That's it, big girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好快逃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'd better run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了吗  听见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you hear that? Yeah uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办  难为你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I gonna do? Yeah, I'm sorry man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要去看吗  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Want to go watch? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  她搬出去了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing? So, uh, did she move out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretty much, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然就这样跟她分手了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe you broke up with her just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.11,0:21:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不适合就是不适合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, When it's not right, you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  死不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay? Yeah! Yeah. I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法让你开心  什么办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what'd cheer you up? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明晚要教侵蚀理论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm giving this lecture on erosion theories tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该来听听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  我确实开心多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, that did cheer me up.
